# Workbench's resource index. Rebuilt on open from the .meta files, which carry the
# GUIDs - so a fresh clone binds to the same identities without it. Tracking it only
# buys binary merge conflicts: it rewrote itself three times in one evening here.
# NOTE: this only holds while every resource has its .meta committed. If you add a
# resource, commit its .meta with it.
resourceDatabase.rdb
